"unit_id": "t0016.u01",
"sent_id": "t0016.s02"
},
{
"start": 127.86,
"end": 132.0,
"speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
"text": "Where do maintenance and transmission mechanics intersect?",
"char_start": 2900,
"char_end": 2958,
"unit_id": "t0016.u01",
"sent_id": "t0016.s03"
},
{
"start": 132.0,
"end": 132.41,
"speaker_label": "Diego Ferrer",
"text": "That's how I see it.",
"char_start": 2973,
"char_end": 2993,
"unit_id": "t0017.u01",
"sent_id": "t0017.s01"
},
{
"start": 132.41,
"end": 135.11,
"speaker_label": "Diego Ferrer",
"text": "Most of the mysterious creaking noises are resolved by cleaning the contact surfaces and re-tightening them to the specified torque.",
"char_start": 2994,
"char_end": 3126,
"unit_id": "t0017.u01",
"sent_id": "t0017.s02"
},
{
"start": 135.11,
"end": 136.48,
"speaker_label": "Diego Ferrer",
"text": "We've seen this happen with equipment that uses Shimano components.",
"char_start": 3127,
"char_end": 3194,
"unit_id": "t0017.u01",
"sent_id": "t0017.s03"
},
{
"start": 136.48,
"end": 138.0,
"speaker_label": "Diego Ferrer",
"text": "I've observed this pattern repeating in three different sets of equipment.",
"char_start": 3195,
"char_end": 3269,
"unit_id": "t0017.u01",
"sent_id": "t0017.s04"
},
{
"start": 138.0,
"end": 139.49,
"speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
"text": "Tell me a specific example.",
"char_start": 3285,
"char_end": 3312,
"unit_id": "t0018.u01",
"sent_id": "t0018.s01"
},
{
"start": 139.49,
"end": 144.0,
"speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
"text": "What is something you used to believe about this that you have since re-evaluated?",
"char_start": 3313,
"char_end": 3395,
"unit_id": "t0018.u01",
"sent_id": "t0018.s02"
},
{
"start": 144.0,
"end": 147.68,
"speaker_label": "Diego Ferrer",
"text": "Yes, see – a bike should feel quiet and predictable so that your attention can stay focused on the trail.",
"char_start": 3410,
"char_end": 3515,
"unit_id": "t0019.u01",
"sent_id": "t0019.s01"
},
{
"start": 147.68,
"end": 150.0,
"speaker_label": "Diego Ferrer",
"text": "Once you understand that, the rest of the decisions become easier.",
"char_start": 3516,
"char_end": 3582,
"unit_id": "t0019.u01",
"sent_id": "t0019.s02"
},
{
"start": 150.0,
"end": 151.11,
"speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
"text": "Let's start there.",
"char_start": 3598,
"char_end": 3616,
"unit_id": "t0020.u01",
"sent_id": "t0020.s01"
},
{
"start": 151.11,
"end": 156.0,
"speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
"text": "What's something you used to believe about this that you've since re-evaluated?",
"char_start": 3617,
"char_end": 3696,
"unit_id": "t0020.u01",
"sent_id": "t0020.s02"
},
{
"start": 156.0,
"end": 156.49,
"speaker_label": "Diego Ferrer",
"text": "That's how I see it.",
"char_start": 3711,
"char_end": 3731,
"unit_id": "t0021.u01",
"sent_id": "t0021.s01"
},
{
"start": 156.49,
"end": 158.99,
"speaker_label": "Diego Ferrer",
"text": "The wear and tear on the chain is the best early indicator of when you'll need to replace the cassette.",
"char_start": 3732,
"char_end": 3835,
"unit_id": "t0021.u01",
"sent_id": "t0021.s02"
},
{
"start": 158.99,
"end": 160.4,
"speaker_label": "Diego Ferrer",
"text": "We've seen this in equipment that uses Shimano components.",
"char_start": 3836,
"char_end": 3894,
"unit_id": "t0021.u01",
"sent_id": "t0021.s03"
},
{
"start": 160.4,
"end": 162.0,
"speaker_label": "Diego Ferrer",
"text": "Once you understand that, the rest of the decisions become easier.",
"char_start": 3895,
"char_end": 3961,
"unit_id": "t0021.u01",
"sent_id": "t0021.s04"
},
{
"start": 162.0,
"end": 168.0,
"speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
"text": "That makes sense.",
"char_start": 3977,
"char_end": 3994,
"unit_id": "t0022.u01",
"sent_id": "t0022.s01"
},
{
"start": 168.0,
"end": 174.0,
"speaker_label": "Diego Ferrer",
"text": "And when teams adopt Spoke & Wrench within that workflow, the value becomes apparent. If you ignore that, you'll end up rebuilding it from scratch a year later.",
"char_start": 4009,
"char_end": 4169,
"unit_id": "t0023.u01",
"sent_id": "t0023.s01"
},
{
"start": 174.0,
"end": 175.4,
"speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
"text": "Let's start with that.",
"char_start": 4185,
"char_end": 4207,
"unit_id": "t0024.u01",
"sent_id": "t0024.s01"
},
{
"start": 175.4,
"end": 180.0,
"speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
"text": "What is the operational aspect that most listeners don't have access to?",
"char_start": 4208,
"char_end": 4280,
"unit_id": "t0024.u01",
"sent_id": "t0024.s02"
},
{
"start": 180.0,
"end": 180.78,
"speaker_label": "Diego Ferrer",
"text": "That's how I see it.",
"char_start": 4295,
"char_end": 4315,
"unit_id": "t0025.u01",
"sent_id": "t0025.s01"
},
{
"start": 180.78,
"end": 183.58,
"speaker_label": "Diego Ferrer",
"text": "The service intervals for the suspension are a risk management decision.",
"char_start": 4316,
"char_end": 4388,
"unit_id": "t0025.u01",
"sent_id": "t0025.s02"
},
{
"start": 183.58,
"end": 186.0,
"speaker_label": "Diego Ferrer",
"text": "I've seen this pattern repeat itself in three different teams.",
"char_start": 4389,
"char_end": 4451,
"unit_id": "t0025.u01",
"sent_id": "t0025.s03"
},
{
"start": 186.0,
"end": 192.0,
"speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
"text": "Let's change the subject – I want to dedicate the final part to risk management.",
"char_start": 4467,
"char_end": 4547,
"unit_id": "t0026.u01",
"sent_id": "t0026.s01"
},
{
"start": 192.0,
"end": 198.0,
"speaker_label": "Diego Ferrer",
"text": "That's where the conversation gets interesting, because the considerations surrounding risk management permeate everything we've discussed.",
"char_start": 4562,
"char_end": 4701,
"unit_id": "t0027.u01",
"sent_id": "t0027.s01"
},
{
"start": 198.0,
"end": 199.76,
"speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
"text": "Tell me a specific example.",
"char_start": 4717,
"char_end": 4744,
"unit_id": "t0028.u01",
"sent_id": "t0028.s01"
},
{
"start": 199.76,
"end": 204.0,
"speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
"text": "What is the most underestimated aspect of transmission mechanics?",
"char_start": 4745,
"char_end": 4810,
"unit_id": "t0028.u01",
"sent_id": "t0028.s02"
},
{
"start": 204.0,
"end": 204.11,
"speaker_label": "Diego Ferrer",
"text": "Sure.",
"char_start": 4825,
"char_end": 4830,
"unit_id": "t0029.u01",
"sent_id": "t0029.s01"
},
{
"start": 204.11,
"end": 206.93,
"speaker_label": "Diego Ferrer",
"text": "Most mysterious creaking noises can be resolved by cleaning the contact surfaces and re-tightening them to the specified torque.",
"char_start": 4831,
"char_end": 4959,
"unit_id": "t0029.u01",
"sent_id": "t0029.s02"
},
{
"start": 206.93,
"end": 208.32,
"speaker_label": "Diego Ferrer",
"text": "We've seen this happen with equipment that uses Spoke & Wrench.",
"char_start": 4960,
"char_end": 5023,
"unit_id": "t0029.u01",
"sent_id": "t0029.s03"
},
{
"start": 208.32,
"end": 210.0,
"speaker_label": "Diego Ferrer",
"text": "I've observed this pattern repeating in three different pieces of equipment.",
"char_start": 5024,
"char_end": 5100,
"unit_id": "t0029.u01",
"sent_id": "t0029.s04"
},
{
"start": 210.0,
"end": 211.56,
"speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
"text": "That's a useful framework.",
"char_start": 5116,
"char_end": 5142,
"unit_id": "t0030.u01",
"sent_id": "t0030.s01"
},
{
"start": 211.56,
"end": 216.0,
"speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
"text": "What is the opposing perspective that most listeners don't have access to?",
"char_start": 5143,
"char_end": 5217,
"unit_id": "t0030.u01",
"sent_id": "t0030.s02"
},
{
"start": 216.0,
"end": 219.64,
"speaker_label": "Diego Ferrer",
"text": "It all boils down to this: a bike should feel quiet and predictable so that your focus remains on the trail.",
"char_start": 5232,
"char_end": 5340,
"unit_id": "t0031.u01",
"sent_id": "t0031.s01"
},
{
"start": 219.64,
"end": 222.0,
"speaker_label": "Diego Ferrer",
"text": "The frame matters because it tells you what compromises you're making.",
"char_start": 5341,
"char_end": 5411,
"unit_id": "t0031.u01",
"sent_id": "t0031.s02"
},
{
"start": 222.0,
"end": 224.18,
"speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
"text": "What does the failure mode look like?",
"char_start": 5427,
"char_end": 5464,
"unit_id": "t0032.u01",
"sent_id": "t0032.s01"
},
{
"start": 224.18,
"end": 228.0,
"speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
"text": "What is the most underestimated aspect of transmission mechanics?",
"char_start": 5465,
"char_end": 5530,
"unit_id": "t0032.u01",
"sent_id": "t0032.s02"
},
{
"start": 228.0,
"end": 230.69,
"speaker_label": "Diego Ferrer",
"text": "Honestly, the wear and tear on the chain is the best early indicator of when you'll need to replace the cassette.",
"char_start": 5545,
"char_end": 5658,
"unit_id": "t0033.u01",
"sent_id": "t0033.s01"
},
{
"start": 230.69,
"end": 232.07,
"speaker_label": "Diego Ferrer",
"text": "We've seen this in equipment that uses Shimano components.",
"char_start": 5659,
"char_end": 5717,
"unit_id": "t0033.u01",
"sent_id": "t0033.s02"
},
{
"start": 232.07,
"end": 234.0,
"speaker_label": "Diego Ferrer",
"text": "I've observed this pattern repeating itself in three different sets of equipment.",
"char_start": 5718,
"char_end": 5799,
"unit_id": "t0033.u01",
"sent_id": "t0033.s03"
},
{
"start": 234.0,
"end": 240.0,
"speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
"text": "Where does that stop working?",
"char_start": 5815,
"char_end": 5844,
"unit_id": "t0034.u01",
"sent_id": "t0034.s01"
},
{
"start": 240.0,
"end": 246.0,
"speaker_label": "Diego Ferrer",
"text": "And when teams adopt Shimano equipment within that system, the benefits become apparent – I've seen this pattern repeat itself in three different teams.",
"char_start": 5859,
"char_end": 6011,
"unit_id": "t0035.u01",
"sent_id": "t0035.s01"
},
{
"start": 246.0,
"end": 248.65,
"speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
"text": "What is the heuristic that you always rely on?",
"char_start": 6027,
"char_end": 6073,
"unit_id": "t0036.u01",
"sent_id": "t0036.s01"
},
{
"start": 248.65,
"end": 252.0,
"speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
"text": "Where do maintenance and transmission mechanics intersect?",
"char_start": 6074,
"char_end": 6132,
"unit_id": "t0036.u01",
"sent_id": "t0036.s02"
},
{
"start": 252.0,
"end": 255.2,
"speaker_label": "Diego Ferrer",
"text": "Frankly, the service intervals for the suspension are a risk management decision.",
"char_start": 6147,
"char_end": 6228,
"unit_id": "t0037.u01",
"sent_id": "t0037.s01"
},
{
"start": 255.2,
"end": 258.0,
"speaker_label": "Diego Ferrer",
"text": "And the second-order effect is the part that almost everyone overlooks.",
"char_start": 6229,
"char_end": 6300,
"unit_id": "t0037.u01",
"sent_id": "t0037.s02"
},
{
"start": 258.0,
"end": 264.0,
"speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
"text": "Before we wrap up, what's one thing that listeners can try out this week?",
"char_start": 6316,
"char_end": 6389,
"unit_id": "t0038.u01",
"sent_id": "t0038.s01"
},
{
"start": 264.0,
"end": 268.21,
"speaker_label": "Diego Ferrer",
"text": "Choose one of the ideas we discussed and implement it for two weeks.",
"char_start": 6404,
"char_end": 6472,
"unit_id": "t0039.u01",
"sent_id": "t0039.s01"
},
{
"start": 268.21,
"end": 270.0,
"speaker_label": "Diego Ferrer",
"text": "Everything else is iteration.",
"char_start": 6473,
"char_end": 6502,
"unit_id": "t0039.u01",
"sent_id": "t0039.s02"
},
{
"start": 270.0,
"end": 272.52,
"speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
"text": "Before we close, thank you again to our friends at Linear.",
"char_start": 6518,
"char_end": 6576,
"unit_id": "t0040.u01",
"sent_id": "t0040.s01"
},
{
"start": 272.52,
"end": 276.0,
"speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
"text": "Linear is the issue tracking system designed for speed – built for the keyboard.",
"char_start": 6577,
"char_end": 6657,
"unit_id": "t0040.u01",
"sent_id": "t0040.s02"
},
{
"start": 276.0,
"end": 282.0,
"speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
"text": "Diego Ferrer, thank you for the conversation.",
"char_start": 6658,
"char_end": 6703,
"unit_id": "t0040.u01",
"sent_id": "t0040.s03"
},
{
"start": 282.0,
"end": 288.0,
"speaker_label": "Diego Ferrer",
"text": "Thank you, Lucía.",
"char_start": 6718,
"char_end": 6735,
"unit_id": "t0041.u01",
"sent_id": "t0041.s01"
},
{
"start": 288.0,
"end": 292.39,
"speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
"text": "That's all for today's episode of Trail Sessions.",
"char_start": 6751,
"char_end": 6800,
"unit_id": "t0042.u01",
"sent_id": "t0042.s01"
},
{
"start": 292.39,
